err←dataChunkToArrow args;arrow_opts;chunk;out_array
⍝ Low-level wrapper for duckdb_data_chunk_to_arrow
⍝ args: (arrow_opts chunk out_arrow_array_ptr)
⍝   arrow_opts: duckdb_arrow_options pointer
⍝   chunk: duckdb_data_chunk pointer
⍝   out_arrow_array_ptr: pointer to ArrowArray struct memory
⍝ err: duckdb_error_data pointer (destroy with destroyErrorData)

(arrow_opts chunk out_array)←args
err←api.duckdb_data_chunk_to_arrow arrow_opts chunk out_array

